<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<base target="_top">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>한솔 해인이의 영어 친구 ABC</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#fff7e6;--ink:#4a3b2a;--p:#ff7aa8;--b:#5bb8ff;--g:#58d68d;--y:#ffd54a;color-scheme:light}
*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Jua","Apple SD Gothic Neo","Malgun Gothic",sans-serif;text-align:center}
.wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px}
h1{font-size:30px;margin:8px 0}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 20px;font-size:22px;font-family:inherit;color:#fff;background:var(--p);box-shadow:0 5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18);cursor:pointer;margin:6px}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.b{background:var(--b)}.g{background:var(--g)}.y{background:var(--y);color:var(--ink)}
.menu .btn{display:block;width:100%;font-size:28px;padding:22px;margin:14px 0}
select{font-size:20px;padding:10px;border-radius:16px;border:3px solid #ffe0a3;font-family:inherit;width:100%;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:32px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.08);margin:10px 0}
.emoji{font-size:120px;line-height:1.15;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;min-height:140px}
.word{font-size:52px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--p);margin:4px 0}
.ko{font-size:26px;opacity:.8}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.home{font-size:20px;padding:8px 14px}
.stars{font-size:22px;min-height:30px}
.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
.choice{background:#fff;border:4px solid #ffe0a3;border-radius:24px;font-size:60px;padding:14px 0;cursor:pointer;min-height:110px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.shake{animation:s .4s}@keyframes s{25%{transform:translateX(-10px)}75%{transform:translateX(10px)}}
.pop{animation:p .5s}@keyframes p{50%{transform:scale(1.25)}}
.msg{font-size:32px;min-height:42px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--g)}
.hidden{display:none}
.note{font-size:15px;opacity:.7;margin-top:10px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<div id="home" class="menu">
  <h1>🌈 한솔 해인이의 영어 친구 ABC 🌈</h1>
  <div style="font-size:90px">🐻</div>
  <select id="cat"></select>
  <button class="btn" onclick="show('learn')">📖 배우기</button>
  <button class="btn b" onclick="show('game')">🎮 게임하기</button>
  <div class="note" id="vnote"></div>
</div>

<div id="learn" class="hidden">
  <div class="top"><button class="btn y home" onclick="show('home')">🏠</button><div class="stars" id="lcount"></div></div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="emoji" id="lemoji" onclick="say(cur().w)"></div>
    <div class="word" id="lword"></div>
    <div class="ko" id="lko"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="lmsg" class="msg"></div>
  <button class="btn" onclick="say(cur().w)">🔊 듣기</button>
  <button class="btn b" onclick="say(cur().w,0.5)">🐢 천천히</button><br>
  <button class="btn g" onclick="repeat()">🎤 따라해봐!</button><br>
  <button class="btn y" onclick="move(-1)">◀ 이전</button>
  <button class="btn y" onclick="move(1)">다음 ▶</button>
</div>

<div id="game" class="hidden">
  <div class="top"><button class="btn y home" onclick="show('home')">🏠</button><div class="stars" id="gstars"></div></div>
  <div class="card">
    <div style="font-size:24px">들어보고 맞는 그림을 눌러요!</div>
    <button class="btn" style="font-size:40px;padding:20px 34px" onclick="say(target.w)">🔊</button>
  </div>
  <div id="gmsg" class="msg"></div>
  <div class="choices" id="choices"></div>
  <div id="end" class="hidden card"><div style="font-size:80px">🏆</div><div class="word" style="font-size:36px">참 잘했어요!</div><button class="btn g" onclick="startGame()">🔁 또 하기</button></div>
</div>

</div>
